    "title": "🧪 Practice 2 (team work): TVC Scriptwriting (30-45s) — 45.0%|||🧪 Practice 2 (team work): TVC Scriptwriting (30-45s) — 45.0%",
    "slug": "ans201-flm-thi-3",
    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Practice 2 (team work): TVC Scriptwriting (30-45s) 45.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANS201 · Assessment 3/3</span>\n<h2>Practice 2 (team work): TVC Scriptwriting (30-45s)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13464 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANS201 · Đầu điểm 3/3</span>\n<h2>Practice 2 (team work): TVC Scriptwriting (30-45s)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13464 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">45.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">270' in class</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO3, CLO5, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Create a 30–45 second TVC script that demonstrates clear structure, effective character design, and a strong brand message. Apply storytelling principles with professionalism, and use AI tools for ideation, storyboarding, demo video creation, or refinement while ensuring originality.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">• Knowledge: Understand 30–45s TVC storytelling and structure, character/arc essentials, and industry-standard script/storyboard conventions and timing.<br>• Skills: Turn a brief into a logline/beat sheet and produce an industry-standard TVC script/storyboard with clear structure and characters; use AI for ideation, storyboarding, demo, or refinement while documenting usage and maintaining originality.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">1. Presentation: Brand Research<br>Conduct a brand research study that analyzes the brand’s history, values, USP, target audience, competitors, and positioning. Use AI tools at the enhanced level to support information synthesis, data analysis, and creative exploration (e.g., generating moodboards, slogans, or initial ideas).<br>2. TVC Scriptwriting - TVC Storyboard - Demo video for the TVC<br>Using insights from your Brand Research, create a 30–45s TVC with:<br>• Script in industry format (scene headings, action, dialogue/VO, transitions).<br>• Storyboard (≈8–12 frames) with captions and timings.<br>• Demo/animatic video (30–45s, MP4) showing pacing and key beats.<br>AI use: Use AI for ideation, rewrites, shot listing/storyboarding, and demo assembly. Document all AI usage (tools, prompts, sources, edits) and ensure originality and authorship.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Submission Files:<br>1. Brand Research Report: Brand analysis, audience research, competitor analysis, narrative outline, AI usage report (enhanced level) (.docx/PDF)<br>2. Final TVC Script (docx/PDF)<br>3. AI-generated storyboard and AI Usage Report (.docx/PDF)<br>4. AI-Generated Demo Video and AI Usage Report: MP4 file (.mp4), resolution min. 720p.<br>In-Class Work:<br>1. Presentation of the script analysis of a chosen short animated film.<br>2. Instructor feedback on brand research, TVC structure, and AI usage<br>3. Drafting and revising script sections during In-class sessions.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
